{"path":"io/manip/showpoint","title":"std::showpoint, std::noshowpoint","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>showpoint, <span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>noshowpoint","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/io/manip/showpoint","section":"io","kind":"page","summary":"Enables or disables the unconditional inclusion of the decimal point character in floating-point output. Has no effect on input.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/ios\">&lt;ios&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base\"><span class=\"kw1686\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ios_base</span></span></a><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> showpoint<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base\"><span class=\"kw1686\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ios_base</span></span></a><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> str <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base\"><span class=\"kw1686\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ios_base</span></span></a><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> noshowpoint<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base\"><span class=\"kw1686\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ios_base</span></span></a><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> str <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Enables or disables the unconditional inclusion of the decimal point character in floating-point output. Has no effect on input.\n</p>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> Enables the <code>showpoint</code> flag in the stream <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">str</span></code> as if by calling <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">str.<span class=\"me1\">setf</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base/fmtflags\"><span class=\"kw1709\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ios_base</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">showpoint</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> Disables the <code>showpoint</code> flag in the stream <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">str</span></code> as if by calling <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">str.<span class=\"me1\">unsetf</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base/fmtflags\"><span class=\"kw1709\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ios_base</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">showpoint</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>.</div>\n<p>This is an I/O manipulator, it may be called with an expression such as <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">out <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">showpoint</span></span></code> for any <code>out</code> of type <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ostream\">std::basic_ostream</a></span> or with an expression such as <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">in <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;&gt;</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">showpoint</span></span></code> for any <code>in</code> of type <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_istream\">std::basic_istream</a></span>.\n</p><p>The character to use as decimal point character is determined by the numpunct facet of the locale imbued in the stream at the time of output, as described in <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/num_put/put\">std::num_put::put</a></span>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> str\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> reference to I/O stream\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">str</span></code> (reference to the stream after manipulation).\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"1.0 with showpoint: \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">showpoint</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"nu16\">1.0</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span>\n              <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"1.0 with noshowpoint: \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">noshowpoint</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"nu16\">1.0</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>1.0 with showpoint: 1.00000\n1.0 with noshowpoint: 1</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/resetiosflags\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>resetiosflags</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  clears the specified ios_base flags <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/setiosflags\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>setiosflags</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  sets the specified <code>ios_base</code> flags <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"io","title":"Input/output library"},{"path":"io/manip","title":"Input/output manipulators"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::showpoint, std::noshowpoint","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"2 declarations. Enables or disables the unconditional inclusion of the decimal point character in floating-point output."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"str"},{"label":"Return value","note":"str (reference to the stream after manipulation)."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"resetiosflags","note":"clears the specified ios_base flags"},{"label":"setiosflags","note":"sets the specified ios_base flags"}]}]},"standards":[],"wordCount":202,"codeBlockCount":2}
